    [
     3,
     "<div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\"><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">I am getting the following error\r\nmessage when I try to merge two sets of scantwo permutations:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Warning message:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">In c.scantwoperm(phe70.PLnlvs.epistasis.1000perms,\r\nphe70.PLnlvs.epistasis.2perm) :<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">  Mismatch in degrees\r\nof freedom; may cause problems.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">Is this problem caused by merging permutations\r\ncreated today using R/QTL 1.24-9 with permutations I created 2 years ago using an\r\nearlier version of R/QTL? How should I deal with this?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">Here’s the code I used to generate\r\nthe permutations:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">&gt;\r\nsummary(phe70.PLnlvs.epistasis.1000perms)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">PLnlvs (998 permutations)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">   \r\nfull  fv1  int \r\nadd  av1  one<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">5% \r\n37.9 37.1 29.9 15.1 14.2 2.40<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">10% 35.7 34.8 27.5 12.9 12.1 2.13<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">phe70.PLnlvs.epistasis.2perm&lt;-scantwo(lcSG1d100,\r\nmethod=&quot;imp&quot;, addcovar=mat, verbose=T, n.perm=2, pheno.col=70)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">&gt;\r\nsummary(phe70.PLnlvs.epistasis.2perm)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">PLnlvs (2 permutations)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">   \r\nfull  fv1  int \r\nadd  av1  one<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">5% \r\n33.4 31.9 27.9 7.75 7.08 2.44<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">10% 33.0 31.6 27.6 7.69 6.98 2.38<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">&gt; join70&lt;-c(phe70.PLnlvs.epistasis.1000perms,phe70.PLnlvs.epistasis.2perm)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">Warning message:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">In\r\nc.scantwoperm(phe70.PLnlvs.epistasis.1000perms, phe70.PLnlvs.epistasis.2perm) :<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"> \r\nMismatch in degrees of freedom; may cause problems.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">When I try to look at for the\r\ndegrees of freedom for the two sets of permutations, I don’t see them for the\r\nsmaller set of 2 permutations.  The larger\r\nset of 998 permutations (which I made on an earlier version of R/qtl, maybe 2\r\nyears ago) has the degrees of freedom listed as attr(,&quot;df&quot;)   full fv1 int add av1 AA    3  \r\n2   1   2   1,\r\nbut the set of 2 perms is missing this.  <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">&gt; phe70.PLnlvs.epistasis.2perm<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">$full<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">       PLnlvs<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">[1,] 33.72182<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">[2,] 26.48398<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">$fv1<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">       PLnlvs<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">[1,] 32.29795<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">[2,] 24.90205<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">$int<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">       PLnlvs<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">[1,] 28.29021<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">[2,] 21.13165<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">$add<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">       PLnlvs<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">[1,] 7.802941<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">[2,] 6.648719<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">$av1<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:0in\">       PLnlvs